{"id": "37142", "title": "邪尊的女人", "author": "张凝", "category": "文学名著", "count": 11, "available": 11, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/37/37142.htm", "intro": "这个小妮子竟然胆敢将他忘得一干二净！？\r\n虽然当年他们相遇时，\r\n他浑身狼狈，满身是伤，\r\n而现在的他身为医药至尊，高高在上，\r\n但，也不该对他一点印象也没有吧？\r\n该死的！枉费他心心念念了她十八年！\r\n不过，无所谓，\r\n现在，他回来了，\r\n他有的是办法叫她想起他！\r\n只不过，这并不是重点，\r\n管她记不记得，\r\n她终究要为他的女人！", "base": "files/article/html/37/37142", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2913162.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "2913163.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "2913165.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "2913166.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "2913167.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "2913168.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "2913169.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "2913170.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "2913171.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "2913172.html", "available": true}, {"title": "终曲", "file": "2913173.html", "available": true}]}